---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { appConfig, isConfiguredEmail } from '../config/app';
const ready = isConfiguredEmail(appConfig.privacyEmail);
---
<BaseLayout title="Account deletion | HealthWallet" description="Instructions for deleting a HealthWallet account and associated app data.">
  <div class="inner-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Manage your data</span><h1>Delete your account</h1><p>How to start deletion in HealthWallet and how to ask for help if you cannot sign in.</p></div></div>
  <div class="container content-wrap">
    <aside class="notice"><strong>Before publishing this page</strong>Confirm that the app's <code>delete-account</code> backend function is deployed and test deletion of an account with records and files. Configure the privacy email below and finalize any legal retention exceptions.</aside>
    <section class="legal-section"><h2>Delete in the app</h2><ol class="steps"><li>Sign in to HealthWallet.</li><li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> and scroll to the <strong>Account</strong> section.</li><li>Tap <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li><li>Read the confirmation dialog, type <strong>DELETE</strong>, and confirm. The app calls the deletion service and signs you out if it succeeds.</li></ol><p class="muted">If the app shows a failure message, the deletion did not complete. Contact support for help.</p></section>
    <section class="legal-section"><h2>What the deletion flow is designed to remove</h2><p>The repository's deletion function removes user-owned profile images, medical documents, and progress photos from its storage buckets before deleting the Supabase authentication user. Linked database records are intended to be removed by database cascade rules. Production behavior and any retained legal or payment records still need verification. The operator must describe exact retention exceptions and backup timing in the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></section>
    <section class="legal-section"><h2>Cannot access your account?</h2><p>Request deletion help at {ready ? <a href={`mailto:${appConfig.privacyEmail}`}>{appConfig.privacyEmail}</a> : <strong>{appConfig.privacyEmail}</strong>}. Include the phone number linked to the account and say that you want to delete your HealthWallet account. Do not send a verification code or medical records by email. The support team will need to verify your identity before acting on a request.</p><p>No request is sent by this website itself; the email address must be made operational by the app operator.</p></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
